# Generated build artifacts (regenerate with opzhubctl module-gen, doc 01 §5)
# — kept tracked so a fresh clone still boots; do not hand-edit.

# Secrets / local overrides — never commit real values (doc 08 §1, doc 09 §5)
**/secrets.env
!**/secrets.env.example
/etc-opzhub-local/
infra/.env
!infra/.env.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
!*.env.example

# TLS certificates / keys — never commit private material (doc 12)
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks

# Logs / runtime
*.log
logs/
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

